{"step_index":384,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-24T00:00:39Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Storage Capacity**\n\nI've successfully freed up around 2.43 GB of storage so far, increasing the capacity from 27.40 GB to 29.83 GB. I need to achieve 5 GB total as requested by Baeyeonmyeong, so I still need to free up approximately 2.6 GB more.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"Write-Host \\\"=== Reaching 5GB+ Space Recovery Target ===\\\"\\n\\n$currentSession = \\\"26e86a6c-7516-4656-86cf-d2a6ca54a02f\\\"\\n\\n# 1. Clean old transcript and tool logs in previous brain sessions\\nWrite-Host \\\"[1/5] Cleaning old brain session transcript logs...\\\"\\n$brainRoot = \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\"\\nif (Test-Path $brainRoot) {\\n    Get-ChildItem -Path $brainRoot -Directory -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object { $_.Name -ne $currentSession } | ForEach-Object {\\n        $logsDir = Join-Path $_.FullName \\\".system_generated\\\\logs\\\"\\n        if (Test-Path $logsDir) {\\n            Remove-Item -Path \\\"$logsDir\\\\transcript_full.jsonl\\\" -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n# 2. Clean Antigravity IDE & Grok Caches\\nWrite-Host \\\"[2/5] Cleaning IDE & Grok caches...\\\"\\n$antigravityIdeCache = \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.antigravity-ide\\\"\\nif (Test-Path $antigravityIdeCache) {\\n    $dirsToClean = @(\\\"logs\\\", \\\"CachedData\\\", \\\"GPUCache\\\", \\\"Cache\\\")\\n    foreach ($d in $dirsToClean) {\\n        $target = Join-Path $antigravityIdeCache $d\\n        if (Test-Path $target) { Remove-Item -Path \\\"$target\\\\*\\\" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n# 3. Compress AppData Programs & Antigravity IDE (LZX)\\nWrite-Host \\\"[3/5] Applying LZX compression to Programs & Antigravity IDE...\\\"\\nif (Test-Path \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Programs\\\") {\\n    compact.exe /c /s /a /i /q /exe:lzx \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Programs\\\\*\\\" | Out-Null\\n}\\nif (Test-Path \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.antigravity-ide\\\") {\\n    compact.exe /c /s /a /i /q /exe:lzx \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.antigravity-ide\\\\*\\\" | Out-Null\\n}\\n\\n# 4. Clean Edge/Chrome IndexedDB & LocalStorage temp files\\nWrite-Host \\\"[4/5] Cleaning Browser IndexedDB/DOM Caches...\\\"\\n$edgeIDB = \\\"$env:LOCALAPPDATA\\\\Microsoft\\\\Edge\\\\User Data\\\\Default\\\\IndexedDB\\\"\\nif (Test-Path $edgeIDB) { Remove-Item -Path \\\"$edgeIDB\\\\*\\\" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }\\n$chromeIDB = \\\"$env:LOCALAPPDATA\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\User Data\\\\Default\\\n<truncated 567 bytes>","Description":"\"Script to reach 5GB+ recovery milestone\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\26e86a6c-7516-4656-86cf-d2a6ca54a02f\\\\scratch\\\\reach_5gb_milestone.ps1\"","toolAction":"\"Writing 5GB milestone script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write reach_5gb_milestone.ps1\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
